	"descriptionMarkdown": "This is the first version of my Space Age Jump Start Base.  It is designed to be as compact as possible while providing everything from red and green sciences that I think would be needed.\n\n### Left side: Furnace Smelter\n  - 2x Iron Half belts\n  - 1x Copper Half belt\n  - 1x Stone Quarter belt\n\n### Middle: Intermediaries\n- 6x Iron Gears\n- 2x Green Circuit 2:3 ratios (4 total)\n- 12x Steel furnaces\n\n### Right side: Hub\n- Yellow belts (underground and splitters)\n- Red belts (underground and splitters)\n- Blue, yellow, and red inserters\n- Gun turrets\n- Yellow and red ammo\n- grey and blue assemblers\n- steel furnaces\n- lamps (and copper wire)\n- medium and big power poles (and iron sticks)\n\n### TODO:\n- Add research.\n- Play test.\n\n## Notes\nThe hub design is heavily inspired by Nilaus's Masterclass Starter Hub. The belt and logistics work taught me a lot about how I could better design my base and this was the result. \n",
